[Bo2's p249 F5.28 (TR, first interval)]

e,1,0,V*u(t)
r,1,2,r
c,2,0,c,0

analysis: tr
note: A source of V*u(t) - V*u(t-to), taken in two intervals. First interval: find vc, the charging curve.
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/bo2s-p249-f5-28-24.jpg
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


[Bo2's p249 F5.28 (TR, second interval)]

r,0,2,r
c,2,0,c,v-e^(-to/(c*r))*v

analysis: tr
note: Second interval, from t = to: the source is a short now, and the capacitor's initial condition is the first interval's vc at to, written out in full.
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/bo2s-p249-f5-28-24.jpg
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


