[Bo2's Drill Exercise 5.11 (DC)]

e,1,0,1
o,1,2,o
c,2,o,1/4
r2,2,o,2
r1,2,0,1

analysis: dc
note: Example 5.7's circuit with a 1/4 F capacitor and the source at 1 V for t < 0: this DC interval gives vc = -2 V.
