[Bo2's Drill Exercise 5.11 (TR)]

e,1,0,3*u(t)
o,1,2,o
c,2,o,1/4,-2
r2,2,o,2
r1,2,0,1

analysis: tr
note: Second interval, source at 3 V: vc comes back 4e^(-2t) - 6. The chapter introduces the `only` tool here, and this entry uses it: only vc is transformed back into time. On a circuit this small the saving is slight; on a heavy one it is the difference between fifteen seconds and ten.
variables: vc
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes
